BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Gang Gang Comedy - Bonnie Tangey
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20260121T193000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20260121T213000
DTSTAMP:20260119T125455
UID:ganggang-10001214-1769023800-1769031000@ganggangcafe.com.au
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ganggangcafe.com.au/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/01/Screenshot-2026-01-08-at-11.18.58-am.png
CREATED:20260108T001948Z
DESCRIPTION:Gang Gang Comedy brings you the best comedians from around the
  world. We’re starting 2026 off with an absolute gem\, Bonnie Tangey. Lo
 cal supports will be the affable Simon Bower\, the very funny Dave Graham 
 and Canberra’s rising star Laura Johnston. Running the evening will be y
 our favourite MC Chris Ryan. \n\n\n\nBonnie Tangey is a bioengineer and co
 median. Often informed by her day job\, her comedy is precise\, absurd\, a
 nd a little bit sinister. Bonnie has appeared on ABC’s Comedy Up Late 
 and Tonightly with Tom Ballard. She’s been a Raw Comedy national finali
 st and was selected for the Melbourne International Comedy Festival’s C
 omedy Zone. \n\n\n\n“Dry and delightfully kooky…she’s here to do som
 ething very different.” – Herald Sun“She’s in cracking good form
 … Strongly recommend.” – Daily Review“Absolutely hilarious.” –
  Squirrel Comedy“Blunt and sarcastic and I loved it… A master of the i
 conic punchline.” – Yak Media \n\n\n\nDoors at 7pm for a 7:30pm show s
 tart. \n\n\n\nTix $22 online Humanitix\, $25 at the door.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260108T001949Z
LOCATION:Gang Gang Cafe\, Shop 4/2 Frencham Pl\, Downer ACT 2602
URL:https://ganggangcafe.com.au/event/gang-gang-comedy-bonnie-tangey/
END:VEVENT
